- "Hi! Did anyone else have delayed social smiles from their baby, and how did things turn out? It’s making me anxious. Thanks!" [sr016-0044]
- "[…] The one thing that worries me is this: when I’m holding her face-to-face at my eye level, she hardly ever makes eye contact with me. If she does, it’s only for about 2–5 seconds before looking away." [sr073-0073]
