BEEN TO A PEDIATRICIAN GOING TO ANOTHER ONE ON FRIDAY X" [sr130-0051]

**But:** A limited response in one setting can coexist with strong engagement elsewhere: "The strange thing is that in every other situation, her eye contact seems really good. If she’s lying on her play mat, during tummy time, getting her diaper changed, in front of a mirror, in her car seat, or if someone else is holding her, she’ll happily look at me, smile a lot (especially if I smile first), and seems really engaged." [sr073-0074]

