- "I won’t lie I’m a bit embarrassed to bring it up to the  doctors next month. I don’t want them thinking it’s a vanity thing. But I have a recessed jaw and I wish my parents caught it and did PT while I was a baby …" [sr053-0102]

- "Does anyone else feel a slight groove inwards on the center back of baby’s head? It is lower than the posterior frontanel, about where the head naturally curves (occipital incline) and is centered." [sr074-0029]

