- "My 20 week old has progressively gotten chattier and chattier until about 3 days ago, where she seems to have stopped babbling all together? […]" [sr101-0033]
- "We did reach out to our pediatrician this morning for reassurance that it’s relatively normal but none of our friend’s children did this so it has us concerned." [sr109-0139]
- "I’m worried because he had previously been making more sounds, and I’m wondering whether the timing after his vaccinations could be related. I understand that the timing doesn’t necessarily mean the vaccines caused it, but the change has made me anxious, especially with his 6-month vaccinations coming up." [sr131-0087]

**But:** One rolling follow-up reports recovery, and the vocalization post reports at least some sounds returning; neither establishes what caused the change: "Hi, yes! She started rolling after 7 days.. it gave me so much anxiety. […]" [sr028-0015] "This continued for nearly 2 months. Recently, he has started making sounds again, such as “ahh” and “uhh,” but he isn’t making raspberries or consonant sounds like “ba,” “ga,” etc." [sr131-0086]

