- "However, whenever we have questions or “issues”, I’m unsure if I should consider her true age or her corrected age. Premature babies are almost always suggested to follow the corrected age, but I don’t often see information in babies born just slightly premature. It also seems strange to do if she’s meeting all of her true age milestones." [sr008-0049]
- "Our question is, is it normal for our two week old to be attempting to army crawl when we have him on our chest AND is it normal for him to be lifting his head on his own for a minute at a time to look around pretty much every time we feed him/hold him/ burp/have him on our chest? […]" [sr038-0123]
